Subject: [PATCH 2/4] state: a checkpoint's Host transfers move only its rings'
 live window (Gemma TTFT -27 ms on the RTX 4090) (#246)

* state: a checkpoint's Host transfers move only its rings' live window (rows of the last window positions), not window + chunk - 1 rows

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

* state: a windowed ring's transfer work prices its live window (Opus review)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

* test: FP8 window payload counts every head's codes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

* audit: test_state_image's expect_rows reads after the stream synchronizes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

* DECISIONS 62: item 3's bytes, half the pause (predicted 280 ms, measured 280-281 on the RTX 4090)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

